cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pymocd in your research, please cite the HP-MOCD paper given
  under preferred-citation, and state the pymocd version you used. If you use
  one of the re-implemented baselines, also cite the paper that defines it;
  see https://csilab.ufop.br/pymocd/citing/.
